# {{description}}

A client for the API described by `{{spec}}`, written in pure Zig with no dependencies beyond the standard library. It covers all {{path_count}} paths ({{operation_count}} operations) of the OpenAPI description, with a struct for every one of the {{schema_count}} schemas.

